%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 0fd4c3c83fae23b4cae61c12ce438472, type: 3}
  m_Name: Tinkerer
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  speakerName: Tinkerer
  defaultPath:
    pathName: Introduction
    paragraphs:
    - 'About time that lazy oaf cleared that tree!

      {freezePlayer}'
    - A girl can only live off of Aloe and Yarrow for so long!
    - You took up the farming task for the town, correct? Well, I just so happen
      to have some new gadgets that needs some field testing.
    - For starters, take this. It is an Automatic Assembly. Old stuff goes in, new
      stuff comes out. Kind of like alchemy. {givePlayerItems}
    - Don't ask me how it works. I forgot. Hard to think with no food!
    - Meet me at my workshop later and I will have some more inventions ready on
      the table.
    - And don't forget your mints!
    emotions: 05000000030000000400000000000000020000000000000003000000
  repeatedItemPath:
    pathName: 
    paragraphs: []
    emotions: 
  paths:
  - pathName: Buy something!
    paragraphs:
    - Anything handy?
    emotions: 00000000
  - pathName: Want to buy this?
    paragraphs:
    - I see you got your eye on the {storeItemName}. It'll cost you {storeItemValue}
      <color=#E0D38F>Mints</color> <sprite index=0>! {dontfreezePlayer}
    emotions: 00000000
  - pathName: Sold!
    paragraphs:
    - Let me know if it actually works! {itemBought} {dontfreezePlayer}
    emotions: 01000000
  - pathName: No Money
    paragraphs:
    - Come back with some more money and I can sell this to you!
    emotions: 02000000
  - pathName: No Space
    paragraphs:
    - I don't think you would be able to carry this.
    emotions: 05000000
  - pathName: Want To Trade for this?
    paragraphs:
    - I can make a {storeItemName} if you have the stuff for one. {dontfreezePlayer}
    emotions: 01000000
  - pathName: Not Enough Items
    paragraphs:
    - I can't build out of nothing!... At least, not yet!
    emotions: 03000000
  - pathName: Ticket Explaination
    paragraphs:
    - Oh! Looks like you got yourselves some Tinker Tickets!
    - Go ahead and insert them into the machine near my workshop. Each ticket will
      grant you another recipee for the Assembly.
    emotions: 0100000000000000
  - pathName: New Stuff
    paragraphs:
    - Great work last night fending off those invaders!
    - I maaaaay have taken the liberty of collecting some scattered parts and materials
      during your robotic rampage while you were occupied...
    - But hey! I have more gear to try out! Check them out!
    emotions: 010000000200000001000000
  - pathName: New Trinket Recipes
    paragraphs:
    - That blasted old man!
    - I caught him filling up my Tinker Ticket machine with a bunch of scribblings
      of what looked like bugs, rambling to himself about some untapped power...
    - The Assembly is a highly sophisticated piece of equipment! It wont just accept
      lousy doodles and miraculously work!
    - I will clear it out tomorrow.
    - In the meantime, feel free to ignore the useless junk that gets pumped out
      of the machine.
    emotions: 0300000000000000050000000200000003000000
  fillerPaths:
  - pathName: Seed Shooter
    paragraphs:
    - Those seed shooters I got stationed outside have been real handy in keeping
      back the nightly attacks on the town.
    - Our botanist never looks thrilled refilling their ammo. Something about "wasting
      precious life" or some jargon.
    - I would like to think our lives are more precious than her puny seeds!
    emotions: 000000000600000003000000
  - pathName: Landmine
    paragraphs:
    - Did you that under the right conditions, the nutrients found in the soil are
      combustable??
    - This innovation has led to the brilliant design of my land mine!
    - ... it just is not very energy efficient...
    emotions: 010000000600000002000000
  - pathName: Compost Bin
    paragraphs:
    - I may have discovered how to harvest ichor directly from the source!
    - While largely untested, my theory suggests that the same method the compost
      bin utilizes to produce nutrient rich compost, could work for creature meat.
    emotions: 0100000000000000
  - pathName: Merchant Materials
    paragraphs:
    - My research would be stagnant, if not for that thing in the wagon.
    - I'm not sure where the goods come from, but the materials provided exhibit
      such potent properties!
    emotions: 0000000005000000
  - pathName: Mist Tech
    paragraphs:
    - Just you wait. While doom rests right outside our doorstep, we are on the cusp...
    - ... of a mist powered technological renaissance!
    emotions: 0000000001000000
  - pathName: Treat my stuff with care
    paragraphs:
    - Whatever you buy from me, make sure you treat it with care!
    - Gears are hard to come by in these times. And what gears that do come in don't
      sell for cheap!
    emotions: 0500000003000000
  - pathName: Why tree fallen
    paragraphs:
    - I wish I could remember how that tree fell onto the bridge in the first place.
    - Tree's don't just slice clean off the stump like that!
    emotions: 0200000003000000
  - pathName: Cul Food
    paragraphs:
    - The food at the Culinarion's stand is soooo addicting! I just can't get enough!
    - I wonder what his trick is...
    emotions: 0100000004000000
  questPaths: []
  itemRecievedPaths:
  - pathName: Go Sell it instead
    paragraphs:
    - I don't have much use for something like that.
    - If you are looking to sell your stuff, I bet that weird wagon fellow will purchase
      it.
    emotions: 0200000000000000
  itemSpecificRemarks:
  - pathName: Go Sell it instead
    paragraphs:
    - I am trying to save up money just like you are!
    - Go find him and sell your things to him.
    emotions: 0500000000000000
  - pathName: Scroll
    paragraphs:
    - This looks like blueprints... for a plant!
    - Are you telling me we can BUILD plants now??
    emotions: 0400000005000000
  - pathName: Ticket
    paragraphs:
    - Looks like someone has been hard at work.
    - Go plop that into my Recipe Machine back in my workshop for your reward!
    emotions: 0000000001000000
  friendshipPath1: []
  friendshipPath2: []
  friendshipPath3: []
  alreadySpoken:
  - pathName: ...
    paragraphs:
    - '...

'
    emotions: 06000000
  branchingPaths: []
  questCompletePaths:
  - pathName: Default Quest Complete
    paragraphs:
    - Thank you for completing my quest!
    emotions: 01000000
  dailyQuestPaths:
  - pathName: Daily Quest
    paragraphs:
    - Quick! You! Yes You! I got a job for ya!
    - ... Pay? Yea sure whatever, just get it done!
    emotions: 0100000004000000
